ANCHOR HELD. The teacher recovers known curvature on all four axes wherever the
quadratic fit is determined AND the neighbourhood is genuinely local. Fixture,
convention, ambient frame and scorer are therefore wired correctly, and a FAIL
at d=20 is a statement about d -- not about this pipeline.
